        "After polishing the assistant, make API calls to the assistant from the client application.",
        "Continue with tutorials on building a complex dialog.",
        "Continue with tutorials on adding slots.",
        "Explore the sample applications.",
        "The answer cites page 1 as the source."
    ]
}
